@startuml A05-action-state
!pragma layout smetana
title A05 输入身份、闪避实例与最终视图（已确认）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

class FPlayerBindingKey <<identity value>> {
 RunId / PawnGeneration
}
class FPlayerInputContext <<Controller 私有>> {
 BindingKey / ControlEpoch / InputSequence
}
class FDodgeExecutionKey <<Movement 私有>> {
 BindingKey / DodgeSerial
}
class FDodgeRuntime <<Movement 唯一可写>> {
 ExecutionKey / Kind / Direction
 MovementActive / Progress
 WindowStart / StartOrder / WindowEnd
}
class FDodgeProtectionSample <<受击时只读结果>> {
 Occurrence / ExecutionKey
 ProtectedAtOccurrence
}
class FPlayerAimFrame <<相机最终输出>> {
 BindingKey / ViewModeRevision
 ViewSerial / Frame / SampleTime
 CameraPosition / Direction / AimRay
}
package "experiment / 纯 C++20" {
 class DodgeSnapshot <<value>> {
 Grounded / Staggered
 AllIncomingKinds / Candidates
 }
 class DodgeParams <<只读参数>>
 class DodgeDecision <<value>> {
 RejectReason or Kind / Direction / Params
 }
 class DodgeRules <<无状态>> {
 {static} Evaluate(Snapshot, Params)
 }
 DodgeRules ..> DodgeSnapshot
 DodgeRules ..> DodgeParams
 DodgeRules ..> DodgeDecision : 返回
}
FPlayerInputContext *-- FPlayerBindingKey
FDodgeExecutionKey *-- FPlayerBindingKey
FDodgeRuntime *-- FDodgeExecutionKey
FPlayerAimFrame *-- FPlayerBindingKey
DodgeDecision ..> FDodgeRuntime : 数据流：UE 适配层读取并提交
FDodgeRuntime ..> FDodgeProtectionSample : 在受击事件点采样

note left of FPlayerInputContext
地图/失焦：递增输入代次，清未消费意图。
不取消已接纳的闪避。
end note
note right of FDodgeRuntime
位移截停只关 MovementActive。
窗口按时间到期；新闪避替换，非累加。
离开运行阶段/重启/解绑强制失效。
end note
note bottom of FDodgeProtectionSample
A06 不复制窗口，不用后来窗口重算旧命中。
时间相同时保留明确事件顺序，禁止追溯免伤。
end note
@enduml
